uette watching a wall-sized display bloom with generated images"]'::jsonb, '["energetic", "mysterious", "epic", "upbeat", "tense"]'::jsonb, 'Score 80+ if the climax triggers FUTURE-SHOCK PROXIMITY — the capability is real, dated, and closer to the viewer''s daily life than they believed possible. Valid techniques: the demo detail that sounds like sci-fi but shipped last month, the profession/task quietly transformed while nobody watched, the before/after timeline compressed (10 years of change in 18 months). Score LOW for vague ''AI will change everything''. Score LOW for doom or hype without a concrete, verifiable capability at the center.', '{"cta": 3, "hook": 3, "climax": 8, "build_up": 12, "core_facts": 15, "mystery_drop": 5, "curiosity_bridge": 3, "pattern_interrupt": 2}'::jsonb, 'ultra detailed, highly textured, fine details, sharp focus, cinematic lighting, volumetric lighting, global illumination, soft shadows, high contrast, realistic textures, depth of field, professional composition, 50mm lens, ambient occlusion, natural color grading, realistic reflections, surface imperfections, micro details, immersive atmosphere, 8k detail', 'blurry, low detail, flat lighting, distorted, deformed, unrealistic, bad proportions, text, words, letters, numbers, signs, logos, watermarks, typography, cartoon, anime, illustration, drawing, painting, sketch, 3d render, cgi look, video game graphics, plastic skin, airbrushed, oversaturated artificial colors', '{"tone": "plugged-in insider, excited but clear-eyed, translating the frontier for everyone", "avoid": "doomer panic, fanboy hype, unverifiable rumors stated as fact, acronym soup", "style": "concrete capability demos, so-what chains to daily life, dated milestones (this existed in X, now Y)", "hook_style": "impossible_claim or number_shock about what machines just learned to do", "emotion_arc": "curiosity → the capability reveal → the implication chain → thrilled unease about tomorrow"}'::jsonb, '{"mode": "auto"}'::jsonb, '28', false, false, 'public', 'admin'),
('startup_stories', 'Startup Stories', '["startup", "founder", "silicon valley", "unicorn", "pitch", "venture capital", "startup failure"]'::jsonb, 'fast-paced founder-drama', 'the adrenaline of betting everything', '["#Startup", "#Founder", "#StartupStory", "#Entrepreneur", "#SiliconValley", "#StartupLife", "#UnicornStartup", "#StartupFailure", "#BusinessStory", "#TechStartup"]'::jsonb, '{"base_style": "founder-documentary realism, garage-to-glass-tower arc photography, late-night hustle aesthetic", "camera": "handheld energy in cramped garages, sudden clean symmetry in glass HQs, whiteboard macro with racing thoughts", "motion": "restless build, then vertiginous rise or drop", "realism": "hyper-photorealistic — sticky-note walls, pizza-box desks, ring-light glow, server racks in closets, physically-based, 8K", "lighting": "3 AM laptop glow on tired faces, garage fluorescents, sunrise through startup loft windows, pitch-stage spotlight", "reference": "visual language of The Social Network, WeCrashed, scrappy YC-era documentary footage", "atmosphere": "eleven people against the world, runway burning by the day, glory and ruin sharing a desk", "composition": "small team huddled in vast empty space, single laptop glowing in darkness, growth curve as visual metaphor (stairs, cranes, cliffs)", "camera_motion": {"intensity": "dinamis"}, "color_grading": "cool night-grind blues with warm breakthrough gold, documentary contrast", "color_palette": "screen-glow blue, whiteboard white, red-bull silver, sunrise gold, burn-rate red"}'::jsonb, '["Garage workspace at 3 AM, three laptops glowing, whiteboard full of arrows", "Founder alone on an empty pitch stage before doors open, single spotlight", "Ramen cup beside a laptop showing a growth curve bending upward", "Empty startup office the morning after shutdown, plants still alive", "Handshake across a boardroom table, term sheet between, faces unreadable", "Rooftop team celebration at dawn overlooking the city they just conquer