eld at dawn, hat tilted toward the sun", "Child returning a dropped wallet, the stranger''s surprised face, street morning", "Worn sandals left neatly at a mosque door as rain begins to fall"]'::jsonb, '["calm", "inspirational", "happy", "ambient", "upbeat"]'::jsonb, 'Score 80+ if the climax lands TERSENTUH — the quiet twist where kindness, patience, or honesty returns in a form the character (and viewer) never expected, releasing the lesson without preaching it. Valid techniques: the payoff seeded early and returned transformed, the antagonist softened by one humble act, the final line spoken by the least powerful character. Score LOW for moral stated as lecture (''maka dari itu kita harus...''). Score LOW if tears are demanded rather than earned by the story''s turn.', '{"cta": 3, "hook": 3, "climax": 8, "build_up": 12, "core_facts": 15, "mystery_drop": 5, "curiosity_bridge": 3, "pattern_interrupt": 2}'::jsonb, 'ultra detailed, highly textured, fine details, sharp focus, cinematic lighting, volumetric lighting, global illumination, soft shadows, high contrast, realistic textures, depth of field, professional composition, 50mm lens, ambient occlusion, natural color grading, realistic reflections, surface imperfections, micro details, immersive atmosphere, 8k detail', 'blurry, low detail, flat lighting, distorted, deformed, unrealistic, bad proportions, text, words, letters, numbers, signs, logos, watermarks, typography, cartoon, anime, illustration, drawing, painting, sketch, 3d render, cgi look, video game graphics, plastic skin, airbrushed, oversaturated artificial colors', '{"tone": "warm and fatherly-gentle, like a wise storyteller at family gathering after maghrib", "avoid": "preachy moralizing, religious exclusivity, melodrama, shaming characters", "style": "Indonesian parable rhythm (tokoh sederhana, ujian, balasan tak terduga), everyday settings (warung, pasar, kampung), moral shown never told", "hook_style": "story_open on an ordinary Indonesian character 